	(text "CAN Transceiver Circuit\n\nSN65HVD230 - 3.3V CAN Transceiver\n- Connects to Teensy 4.1 CAN1 controller\n- CTX1 (Pin 22) -> D (Transmit Data)\n- CRX1 (Pin 23) -> R (Receive Data)\n\nFeatures:\n- 3.3V operation (compatible with Teensy)\n- Up to 1 Mbps data rate\n- Low-power standby mode (Rs pin)\n- ESD protection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
